OWASP attribution
-----------------
This tool maps its findings to the risk taxonomy of the OWASP Agentic Skills
Top 10 project:

    https://github.com/OWASP/www-project-agentic-skills-top-10

The OWASP project's documentation is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. This tool
does not reproduce its text; it references the control identifiers (AST01-AST10)
and writes its own descriptions, rationales, and remediation guidance. The
AST identifier names and taxonomy are attributed to that project.

Where a rule's guidance overlaps with an OWASP checklist item, the rule catalog
in docs/OWASP-MAPPING.md records the corresponding control. Any redistribution
of OWASP-derived content must comply with CC BY-SA 4.0.
